Happy to announce that the University of Technology Nuremberg is a founding member of the new ELLIS Unit Franconia. This marks the beginning of many exciting activities and research initiatives.

@ELLISforEurope: "Seven new ELLIS Units join our network. Units in Franconia, Grenoble, and NRW strengthen existing hubs; Slovenia and Sweden add new countries; Czechia and Denmark expand from city to national units."

ELLIS Units are key to building a strong European AI research ecosystem. They serve as local hubs of scientific excellence, fostering collaboration among outstanding researchers across disciplines and supporting long-term research development."
